\\u559d\\u8336|h\\u0113ch\\u00e1]]: Minum teh\\n------\\n\\n\\nGrammatical structure:\\n\\nFrasa kata kerja-objek\",\"pt\":\"\\u5bf9\\n\\n\\nKeyword:\\n\\n\\n[[\\u559d\\u8336|h\\u0113ch\\u00e1]]: Beber ch\\u00e1\\n------\\n\\n\\nGrammatical structure:\\n\\nFrase verbo-objeto\",\"km\":\"Answer:\\n\\n\\u5bf9\\n\\n\\nKeyword:\\n\\n\\n[[\\u559d\\u8336|h\\u0113ch\\u00e1]]: Drink tea\\n------\\n\\n\\nGrammatical structure:\\n\\nVerb-object phrase\",\"nl\":\"\\u5bf9\\n\\n\\nKeyword:\\n\\n\\n[[\\u559d\\u8336|h\\u0113ch\\u00e1]]: Thee drinken\\n------\\n\\n\\nGrammaticale structuur:\\n\\nWerkwoord-object frase\",\"es\":\"\\u5bf9\\n\\n\\nKeyword:\\n\\n\\n[[\\u559d\\u8336|h\\u0113ch\\u00e1]]: Beber t\\u00e9\\n------\\n\\n\\nGrammatical structure:\\n\\nFrase verbo-objeto\"}', '{\"vi\":\"\",\"en\":\"\"}', '[\"vi\",\"en\"]', 5, '2025-12-22 00:39:54', '2025-12-22 00:39:54'),
